{"from": "passage:jn-06-30", "type": "related_to", "to": "passage:mt-12-38", "note": "Different events with similar content: the crowd fed the day before asks 'What sign do you do?' at Capernaum (John 6:30); Matthew 12:38 has scribes and Pharisees ask for a sign elsewhere. The same sign-demand motif, not the same occasion."}
{"from": "passage:jn-06-30", "type": "related_to", "to": "passage:mk-08-11", "note": "Different events with similar content: the crowd fed the day before asks 'What sign do you do?' at Capernaum (John 6:30); Mark 8:11 has Pharisees seek a sign from heaven at another stopping point. The same sign-demand motif, not the same occasion."}
